// Arc Lightning — "Arc Lightning deals 3 damage divided as you choose among
// one, two, or three target creatures and/or players." A TARGETED spell
// ([CR#115.1,601.2c]): the `Targeted` wrapper announces ONE plural target spec
// (1–3 creature/player targets), and the divided-distribution effect
// ([CR#601.2d]) reads that announced slot back BY POSITION as `Targets(0)`
// — an announced target is an indexed entry in the announce list, never an
// anaphor over the antecedent stack ([CR#115.3]). 3 is split across
// the targets, each element bound in turn as `It` with its `Allotment`
// share, which the body (`DealDamage(This, Allotment, It)`) reads. One
// primitive expresses divided damage; the same shape with a `PutCounters` body
// is divided counters.
Normal(
  name: "Arc Lightning",
  mana_cost: [
    Generic(2),
    Red,
  ],
  types: [
    Sorcery,
  ],
  abilities: [
    Spell(
      effect: Targeted(
        targets: [Target(Between(1, 3), AnyTarget)],
        effect: Distribute(
          amount: 3,
          binder: Existing(Targets(0)),
          body: DealDamage(This, Allotment, It),
        ),
      ),
    ),
  ],
)
